:name: Bootloader migration (old 4K -> new 16K) on the REAL apps, in Renode
:description: Flash the packed migrate_big.bin at 0x08001000 (as the stock IAP
:description: would), boot the trampoline, which jumps to the updater @0x08004000,
:description: which installs the embedded new bootloader at 0x08000000.
using sysbus
$repo ?= @C:/Users/Layer/Documents/Ninebot-G30-Custom
logLevel 3

mach create "g30-migrate"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32f103.repl

# The stock 4 KB bootloader flashed the big migration app at 0x08001000.
sysbus LoadBinary $repo/firmware/migration/build/migrate_big.bin 0x08001000

# Emulate the stock bootloader handing off to the app: it reads SP/PC from 0x0,
# so put the trampoline's reset vector there (the trampoline lives at 0x08001000).
$sp ?= 0x20000400
$pc ?= 0x080010F1
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x00000000 $sp
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x00000004 $pc
machine Reset

emulation RunFor "00:00:02"

# Inspect (printed in order): cookie magic, cookie status, new-BL SP, new-BL reset
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20004F00
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20004F04
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x08000000
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x08000004
quit
